# an unknown kind
up/urls.go:17:51: unknown kind "jpg" in accept of form field Doc
  fix: did you mean "jpeg"? allowed: gif, jpeg, pdf, png, webp, zip

# accept on text
up/urls.go:16:36: accept applies to file fields, but form field Title is string
  fix: remove accept, or make the field maago.Field[maago.File]

# max on a file
up/urls.go:17:40: max applies to strings, but form field Doc is maago.File
  fix: remove max

# an API route
up/urls.go:21:2: UpIn.Form reads form UpForm, which has a file, but route up_save is an API route, which reads JSON
  fix: send the file from an HTML form, to a route without maago.API

# a model form
up/urls.go:23:8: form field Doc is a file, but a model form takes its fields from model Up, which holds no file
  fix: read the file with a form of its own, on a route of its own

# no enctype
up/templates/up_page.html: route up_form reads a form with a file, but its page draws no form with enctype="multipart/form-data"
  fix: write <form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"> in the page or base.html; without it the browser sends the file's name, not the file
  see: maago doc template

